description	"Rebel Outrider

An elite Special Forces operative relying on custom dual-wielded DH-17 carbines, high evasive mobility, and pure combat grit.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dual DH-17 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- Clone Pistols
-- 20%- Damage/FP Drain
-- 25%+ RoF
-- 25%- Velocity
-- 60% Slower Mag Reload
-- Mag Reload
- Concussion Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Blast Armor
- Getups (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Slow Faller
- Bunny Hop (0)
- Sense Immunity
- Grapple Hop
- Assemble (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- 40% Slower Skill Cooldowns

^3Abilities:
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS1]
-- Cripples On Hit, 50% Less Damage
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]"